{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation pushed as Gerrit change 1376 (Change-Id If7bd2a62a5b01b39d6d57ba8208981e10fb5994e, patchset 1, commit e65c5e0ea5).\n\nTDD trail: RED behavioral suite tests/interfaces/store/test_git_contention_9305.py written and confirmed failing first (a transient index.lock held ~3s by a competing process hard-failed the write under the old ~2s budget), then the seam changes turned it green:\n\n- gitutil._store_git_op_lock: per-store advisory flock (rebar-git-op.lock in the tracker git dir) held across each _with_index_lock_retry run — non-blocking uncontended (test: zero sleeps on the happy path), kernel-released on death, bounded jittered wait (30s) then proceed-without at warning (advisory; git-level retry governs).\n- _with_index_lock_retry: jittered (uniform 0.75-1.25x) exponential backoff capped 5s, 10 attempts (~21s nominal budget — _lock_retry_budget_s pinned to [10s,60s] by test); ref-lock signature (cannot lock ref / *.lock File exists) now retried too; stale reclamation stays index.lock-only; exhaustion folds actionable guidance into stderr naming the contended lock file + remedy.\n- lock.py: jittered the 50ms/100ms contention sleeps (research rec 4).\n- Watchdogs (AC: bounded-or-documented per site): run_git_write 120s rc-124 fold (txn/compact/delete); fsck both read sites 120s; metrics blame + git_metrics 300s (TimeoutExpired -> existing best-effort None / per-metric unavailable via _commands/metrics.py fault isolation); event_append keeps its 30s.\n- compact.py: the two failure branches that discarded cp.stderr now include it so the exhaustion guidance reaches the operator.\n\nValidation: new suite 9/9 green; related regression suites (interfaces/store, compact/delete index-lock, run_git wrapper, git-timeout bounds, raw-git lint, store concurrency) 387 passed / 1 failed — the 1 failure (test_tracker_config_e2e::test_custom_dir_and_branch_init_and_sync_roundtrip) reproduces on UNMODIFIED origin/main f70e5d2101 in this env, pre-existing and unrelated. make lint + make typecheck exit zero. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785865020800190001,"uuid":"e63a4858-9710-4c6c-809e-871cf5cb73bd"}